<title>SINGAPORE: Avimo full year net up 28.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Avimo full year net up 28.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   8.00	vs	6.21</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)		    15.00	vs     13.75</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)		  7.66	vs	5.96</p>
<p>    Turnover			   117.88	vs     92.40</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     8.04	vs	5.58</p>
<p>    Associates			   1.74	vs	3.09</p>
<p>    Tax				    1.72	vs	2.45</p>
<p>    Interest expense		   2.14	vs	2.95</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		   (0.90)     vs	nil</p>
<p>    Div register/pay   March 6 1997/ March 25 1997</p>
<p>Note - Aerospace optic and laser systems maker Avimo Group Ltd is 38 percent owned by British defence manufacturer Alvis Plc.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
